
@url = http://localhost:3000

### calcular
POST {{url}}/posteos
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "alto": 60,
    "ancho": 45
}

### calcular números negativo

POST {{url}}/posteos
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "alto": 25,
    "ancho": -45
}

### mostrar resultados 

GET {{url}}/llamadas